&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Engineer (m/f/d) Computer Vision for Robotics&lt;/strong&gt;, who will design and train deep-learning models for visual servoing in precision robot manipulation. Your model&#39;s output steers the robot as it moves, so inference latency and sub-millimetre accuracy both decide whether the task succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop deep-learning methods for visual servoing and robotic vision, adapting and combining existing methods for new tasks where that requires significant changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, train, fine-tune, and evaluate models in PyTorch, including adapting pretrained and foundation models to real robot tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perception Methods:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop 2D and 3D perception for pose estimation, depth, tracking, and geometric understanding, combining learned, classical, and optimization-based methods where each fits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed-Loop Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate learned models into closed-loop robot control for high-precision manipulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robot Evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate models on real robots and precision manipulation tasks, analyse failure cases, and improve robustness and generalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-Time Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Build real-time inference pipelines in C++ and Python and optimize models with ONNX, TensorRT, and CUDA to meet the timing of the control loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree or PhD in computer science, robotics, electrical engineering, or a related field, or an equivalent combination of research and industry experience, with three or more years in machine learning, computer vision, or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ML Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience designing, training, and tuning deep-learning models end to end in PyTorch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience adapting, combining, or extending existing machine learning or vision methods for a new task, with changes that required understanding how those methods work internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Computer Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of computer vision and 2D/3D geometry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Software development in Python, with working knowledge of C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robot Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of robot kinematics, feedback control, or visual servoing, or experience with high-precision manipulation. The team supports candidates in building this experience on the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience deploying optimized models with ONNX, TensorRT, or comparable frameworks, including on embedded or industrial GPU platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robot Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with reinforcement learning or imitation learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial Cameras:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with industrial 2D/3D cameras, lens models, camera calibration, or point clouds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robotics Middleware:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with ROS or ROS 2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is seeking an experienced Regional Services Partner to lead our Enterprise Sector Services business in the EMEA Central region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of commercial ownership, customer engagement, and delivery excellence. You will be responsible for driving services bookings growth across federal, state, and regulated public institutions while ensuring successful execution of a portfolio of complex engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Regional Services Leader, you will partner closely with Enterprise Sector Account Executives, Solution Architects, Delivery teams, and Customer Success to define and execute tailored services strategies that accelerate time to value and drive long-term adoption of Elastic solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means consistently achieving Services bookings and revenue targets while delivering predictable, high-quality outcomes for Enterprise Sector customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and achieve Services bookings and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory services strategy aligned with account plans and long-term adoption objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting and proactively manage pipeline gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the services bid and negotiation lifecycle, including scope, pricing, contract structures, and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive discovery and shape outcome-oriented services offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling Statements of Work tied to measurable milestones and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Elastic Services as a strategic enabler for transformation initiatives within Enterprise&amp;nbsp; Sector organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a portfolio of concurrent engagements, ensuring delivery within cost, margin, and customer satisfaction expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide governance oversight for strategic accounts, managing escalations and aligning Sales, Delivery, and Customer Success stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate risks, facilitate steering meetings, and ensure structured reporting and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic advisor, aligning Elastic Services to customer mission objectives and regulatory constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively within a matrixed organization across Sales, Delivery, Operations, and Partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Professional Services, program delivery, or pre-sales roles within enterprise technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with Enterprise Sector organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven commercial ownership of services bookings targets, including forecasting and complex contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in delivering technology solutions in search, observability, analytics, or security domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple concurrent engagements with governance and risk oversight responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50% (and occasionally internationally).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Elasticsearch and related technologies (Linux, NoSQL, distributed systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, or Scrum Master certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a billable consultant or project manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain SU2 security clearance if required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-PF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
